{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位重點提要｜11月16日\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/MAG-PROMO-261116.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】公屋輪候時間預料會降至4.5年，還有何措施可以加快流轉？房委會就通過提高「家有初生家庭」按揭成數等措施，成效有幾大？</p><p>周一的《時事全方位》，請來嘉賓討論。</p><p>題目：加快公屋流轉</p><p>熱線電話：1833298</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T10:59:31.118970+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T10:21:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T00:22:52.214594+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T10:53:28.797161+00:00","content_hash":"86200f5d259ddd004f47aa7496861d096d2b855ea10e8789b6ea1ab2d61d581b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}